	(text_box "Shift order (verified from the hardware chain): 74HC165 Q7 -> next DS, with the PLC input banks assigned to their nearest 74HC165 data pins; 74HC595 SER enters the OUT0-7 register and QH' continues to the keyboard byte. Both 32-bit chains share one hardware clock. The 595 data/clock/latch controls use consecutive GPIO20/21/22 for uCNC RP2350 PIO compatibility. Latch is simultaneous."
